    "description": "# DL-7: Links Related List\n\n_Give the deal record a working list of its links, with create, bulk-edit, and per-row actions._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Columns: Link ID, Link Code, Tracking URL, Assignment Cap, Active Assignments (count of reps currently on that link), Active\n\n* Actions: New Link, Edit Links (bulk inline edit), per-row edit/delete\n* Deletion is blocked where assignments exist on that link\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Inline toggle editing for Active inside the bulk-edit grid may be technically tricky to build. If so, fall back to a per-record edit modal instead of inline bulk toggle editing. Confirm bulk inline edit vs. per-record modal fallback before building.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: DL-7 (Deal Record User Stories doc).\n* Correction to source doc: the doc attributes the full \"inline toggle might be tricky... worst case, an edit button\" quote to Kobi alone — the transcript shows the first half is Joyce Kiddell and only the second half is Kobi Kunasekaran. See comment for the corrected, timestamped quotes.\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Deal Record User Stories — Google Doc](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IIfaPIol2HmX8v09gw0SKQyCuoHTiwrJxdDNc7qtvB8/edit)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Joyce Kiddell, 44:14 (flags inline toggle risk)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=2654)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Kobi Kunasekaran, 44:50 (proposes edit-button fallback)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=2690)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-216 — Deal: Link Object + Assignment Fields (toggle)](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693812480978/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Deal record documentation review.\n\n",
